1
00:00:00,801 --> 00:00:02,721
(Leonard:)Sheldon, why didn't you tell me?

2
00:00:02,886 --> 00:00:07,056
(Sheldon:)My bad.
I did send a gift from both of us.

3
00:00:07,224 --> 00:00:10,764
(Beverley:)She's a remarkable girl. The youngest
appeals-court judge in New Jersey...

4
00:00:10,936 --> 00:00:13,936
(Beverley:)...and a two-time
Olympic bronze medalist.

5
00:00:14,147 --> 00:00:15,397
(Leonard:)You must be very happy.

6
00:00:15,565 --> 00:00:17,145
(Beverley:)Why? I'm not marrying her.

7
00:00:18,819 --> 00:00:21,739
(Beverley:)So how about you?
Are you seeing anyone interesting?

8
00:00:21,905 --> 00:00:23,945
(Sheldon:)Well, I'm not sure
about interesting, but--

9
00:00:24,116 --> 00:00:26,906
(Leonard:)-Not the time, Sheldon.
-Very well.

10
00:00:27,077 --> 00:00:31,667
(Sheldon:)Shall we switch topics
to Isaac Newton v. Gottfried Leibniz?

11
00:00:31,832 --> 00:00:33,162
(Beverley:)It's all right, Sheldon.

12
00:00:33,333 --> 00:00:36,583
(Beverley:)I will just pretend that Leonard's
not withholding information.

13
00:00:37,170 --> 00:00:40,670
(Beverley:)Although, I will point out, Leonard,
that I am a trained psychiatrist...

14
00:00:40,841 --> 00:00:43,841
(Beverley:)...and you are exhibiting
the same secretive behavioral tics...

15
00:00:44,052 --> 00:00:46,342
(Beverley:)...that accompanied
your learning to masturbate.

16
00:00:49,599 --> 00:00:52,189
Isn’t she brilliant, Leonard?

17
00:00:52,352 --> 00:00:55,022
(Sheldon:)How I envy you.

18
00:00:56,690 --> 00:00:59,690
(Beverley:)So, Howard, have you and Rajesh
finally summoned the courage...

19
00:00:59,860 --> 00:01:07,030
(Beverley:)...to express your latent
homosexual feelings towards one another?

